# Lines tools/qemu-test must see, in this order, as whole serial lines.
# In QEMU: the ramfb display PD shows a test pattern; then
# qemu-test compares QEMU's screen with display-test.screen.png.
NOWAYOS: ramfb: starting
NOWAYOS: ramfb: found QEMU's fw_cfg device, with DMA
NOWAYOS: ramfb: found etc/ramfb (28 bytes)
NOWAYOS: ramfb: showing an 800x480 test pattern

# Output that fails the test at once if it appears anywhere (substring match):
# a fault reported by the Microkit monitor, a kernel error message, a panic,
# or the PD giving up.
!MON|ERROR
!seL4(CPU
!panicked
!gave up
